{"suttaId":"thag1.117","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[675,678],"vripara":"117"},"segments":{"thag1.117:0.4":"Yasattheragāthā","thag1.117:1.1":"“Suvilitto suvasano,","thag1.117:1.2":"sabbābharaṇabhūsito;","thag1.117:1.3":"Tisso vijjā ajjhagamiṃ,","thag1.117:1.4":"kataṃ buddhassa sāsana”nti. …","thag1.117:1.5":"Yaso thero…. 8."},"unsure":[],"preface":[],"attha":{"book":"Th-a-i","bookName":"Theragāthā-1-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0508a1.att","from":2979,"to":2979,"paras":[{"para":2979,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag1.117:1"],"lines":["Tattha <b>suvilitto</b>ti sundarena kuṅkumacandanānulepanena vilittagatto.","<b>Suvasano</b>ti suṭṭhu mahagghakāsikavatthavasano.","<b>Sabbābharaṇabhūsito</b>ti sīsūpagādīhi sabbehi ābharaṇehi alaṅkato.","<b>Ajjhagami</b>nti adhigacchiṃ.","Sesaṃ vuttanayameva."],"lineRefs":[["thag1.117:1"],["thag1.117:1"],["thag1.117:1"],["thag1.117:1"],["thag1.117:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["thag1.117:1.1","suvilitto",0,0],["thag1.117:1.1","suvasano",0,1],["thag1.117:1.1","sabbābharaṇabhūsito",0,2],["thag1.117:1.3","ajjhagamiṃ",0,3]],"before":[{"para":2921,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā"]},{"para":2922,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["<b>Suvilitto</b> <b>suvasano</b>ti āyasmato yasattherassa gāthā.","Kā uppatti?","Ayampi purimabuddhesu katādhikāro tattha tattha bhave vivaṭṭūpanissayāni puññāni upacinanto sumedhassa bhagavato kāle mahānubhāvo nāgarājā hutvā buddhappamukhaṃ bhikkhusaṅghaṃ attano bhavanaṃ netvā mahādānaṃ pavattesi.","Bhagavantaṃ mahagghena ticīvarena acchādesi, ekamekañca bhikkhuṃ mahaggheneva paccekadussayugena sabbena samaṇaparikkhārena acchādesi.","So tena puññakammena devamanussesu saṃsaranto siddhatthassa bhagavato kāle seṭṭhiputto hutvā mahābodhimaṇḍaṃ sattahi ratanehi pūjesi.","Kassapassa bhagavato kāle sāsane pabbajitvā samaṇadhammaṃ akāsi.","Evaṃ sugatīsuyeva saṃsaranto imasmiṃ amhākaṃ bhagavato kāle bārāṇasiyaṃ mahāvibhavassa seṭṭhino putto hutvā nibbatti, <b>yaso</b> nāma nāmena paramasukhumālo.","“Tassa tayo pāsādā”ti sabbaṃ khandhake (mahāva. 25) āgatanayena veditabbaṃ."]},{"para":2923,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["So pubbahetunā codiyamāno rattibhāge niddābhibhūtassa parijanassa vippakāraṃ disvā sañjātasaṃvego suvaṇṇapādukārūḷhova gehato niggato devatāvivaṭena nagaradvārena nikkhamitvā isipatanasamīpaṃ gato “upaddutaṃ vata, bho, upassaṭṭhaṃ vata, bho”ti āha.","Tena samayena bhagavatā isipatane viharantena tasseva anuggaṇhanatthaṃ abbhokāse caṅkamantena “ehi, yasa, idaṃ anupaddutaṃ, idaṃ anupassaṭṭha”nti vutto, “anupaddutaṃ anupassaṭṭhaṃ kira atthī”ti somanassajāto suvaṇṇapādukā oruyha bhagavantaṃ upasaṅkamitvā ekamantaṃ nisinno satthārā anupubbikathaṃ kathetvā saccadesanāya katāya saccapariyosāne sotāpanno hutvā gavesanatthaṃ āgatassa pitu bhagavatā saccadesanāya kariyamānāya arahattaṃ sacchākāsi.","Tena vuttaṃ <b>apadāne</b> (apa. thera 1.40.456-483) –"]},{"para":2924,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Mahāsamuddaṃ oggayha, bhavanaṃ me sunimmitaṃ;"]},{"para":2925,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Sunimmitā pokkharaṇī, cakkavākapakūjitā."]},{"para":2926,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Mandālakehi sañchannā, padumuppalakehi ca;"]},{"para":2927,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Nadī ca sandate tattha, supatitthā manoramā."]},{"para":2928,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Macchakacchapasañchannā, nānādijasamotthatā;"]},{"para":2929,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Mayūrakoñcābhirudā, kokilādīhi vagguhi."]},{"para":2930,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Pārevatā ravihaṃsā ca, cakkavākā nadīcarā;"]},{"para":2931,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Dindibhā sāḷikā cettha, pammakā jīvajīvakā."]},{"para":2932,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Haṃsā koñcāpi naditā, kosiyā piṅgalā bahū;"]},{"para":2933,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Sattaratanasampannā, maṇimuttikavālukā."]},{"para":2934,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Sabbasoṇṇamayā rukkhā, nānāgandhasameritā;"]},{"para":2935,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Ujjotenti divārattiṃ, bhavanaṃ sabbakālikaṃ."]},{"para":2936,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Saṭṭhitūriyasahassāni, sāyaṃ pāto pavajjare;"]},{"para":2937,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Soḷasitthisahassāni, parivārenti maṃ sadā."]},{"para":2938,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Abhinikkhamma bhavanā, sumedhaṃ lokanāyakaṃ;"]},{"para":2939,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Pasannacitto sumano, vandayiṃ taṃ mahāyasaṃ."]},{"para":2940,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Sambuddhaṃ abhivādetvā, sasaṅghaṃ taṃ nimantayiṃ;"]},{"para":2941,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Adhivāsesi so dhīro, sumedho lokanāyako."]},{"para":2942,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Mama dhammakathaṃ katvā, uyyojesi mahāmuni;"]},{"para":2943,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Sambuddhaṃ abhivādetvā, bhavanaṃ me upāgamiṃ."]},{"para":2944,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Āmantayiṃ parijanaṃ, sabbe sannipatātha vo;"]},{"para":2945,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Pubbaṇhasamayaṃ buddho, bhavanaṃ āgamissati."]},{"para":2946,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Lābhā amhaṃ suladdhaṃ no, ye vasāma tavantike;"]},{"para":2947,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Mayampi buddhaseṭṭhassa, pūjaṃ kassāma satthuno."]},{"para":2948,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Annaṃ pānaṃ paṭṭhapetvā, kālaṃ ārocayiṃ ahaṃ;"]},{"para":2949,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Vasīsatasahassehi, upesi lokanāyako."]},{"para":2950,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Pañcaṅgikehi tūriyehi, paccuggamanamakāsahaṃ;"]},{"para":2951,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Sabbasoṇṇamaye pīṭhe, nisīdi purisuttamo."]},{"para":2952,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Uparicchadanaṃ āsi, sabbasoṇṇamayaṃ tadā;"]},{"para":2953,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Bījaniyo pavāyanti, bhikkhusaṅghassa antare."]},{"para":2954,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Pahūtenannapānena, bhikkhusaṅghamatappayiṃ;"]},{"para":2955,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Paccekadussayugaḷe, bhikkhusaṅghassadāsahaṃ."]},{"para":2956,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Yaṃ vadanti sumedhoti, lokāhutipaṭiggahaṃ;"]},{"para":2957,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Bhikkhusaṅghe nisīditvā, imā gāthā abhāsatha."]},{"para":2958,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Yo me annena pānena, sabbe ime ca tappayiṃ;"]},{"para":2959,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Tamahaṃ kittayissāmi, suṇātha mama bhāsato."]},{"para":2960,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Aṭṭhārase kappasate, devaloke ramissati;"]},{"para":2961,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Sahassakkhattuṃ rājā ca, cakkavattī bhavissati."]},{"para":2962,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Upapajjati yaṃ yoniṃ, devattaṃ atha mānusaṃ;"]},{"para":2963,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Sabbadā sabbasovaṇṇaṃ, chadanaṃ dhārayissati."]},{"para":2964,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Tiṃsakappasahassamhi, okkākakulasambhavo;"]},{"para":2965,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Gotamo nāma gottena, satthā loke bhavissati."]},{"para":2966,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Tassa dhammesu dāyādo, oraso dhammanimmito;"]},{"para":2967,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Sabbāsave pariññāya, nibbāyissatināsavo."]},{"para":2968,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Bhikkhusaṅghe nisīditvā, sīhanādaṃ nadissati;"]},{"para":2969,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Citake chattaṃ dhārenti, heṭṭhā chattamhi ḍayhatha."]},{"para":2970,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Sāmaññaṃ me anuppattaṃ, kilesā jhāpitā mayā;"]},{"para":2971,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Maṇḍape rukkhamūle vā, santāpo me na vijjati."]},{"para":2972,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Tiṃsakappasahassamhi, yaṃ dānamadadiṃ tadā;"]},{"para":2973,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, sabbadānassidaṃ phalaṃ."]},{"para":2974,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ…pe… kataṃ buddhassa sāsana”nti."]},{"para":2975,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Atha bhagavā āyasmantaṃ yasaṃ dakkhiṇaṃ bāhuṃ pasāretvā “ehi bhikkhū”ti āha.","Vacanasamanantarameva dvaṅgulamattakesamassu aṭṭhaparikkhāradharo vassasaṭṭhikatthero viya ahosi.","So attano paṭipattiṃ paccavekkhitvā udānento ehibhikkhubhāvappattito purimāvatthavasena – 117."]},{"para":2977,"vripara":"117","title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Suvilitto suvasano, sabbābharaṇabhūsito;"]},{"para":2978,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Tisso vijjā ajjhagamiṃ, kataṃ buddhassa sāsana”nti. –","gāthaṃ abhāsi;"]}],"after":[{"para":2980,"vripara":null,"title":"Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Yasattheragāthāvaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā. 8."]}]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
